From 516609e626f6521a059005f4fd8d6074625ccade Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Hsieh <mike_hsieh@quantatw.com>
Date: Tue, 5 May 2026 20:34:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] nvidia-gpu: add support for SMA leak sensors
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The patch adds support for SMA leak sensor reading. It introduces a
voltage sensor for leakage detection.

Key changes:
- NvidiaSmaLeakSensor: A new sensor class that represents leak detection
  ADC readings. It handles MCTP GET_LEAK_DETECTION_INFO requests and
  parses the response payloads.
- NvidiaSmaDevice: Instantiates the leak sensor alongside the existing
  temperature sensor for each SMA.
- NvidiaGpuMctpVdm: Added command definitions and unpacking logic to
  decode the GET_LEAK_DETECTION_INFO response buffer.

Tested: Build an image for sanmiguel platform.

1. Deployed the built nvidiagpusensor to a sanmiguel BMC. Verified
   that the leak detector voltage sensors appeared correctly under
   each SMA:
```
busctl tree xyz.openbmc_project.GpuSensor
└─ /xyz
  └─ /xyz/openbmc_project
    ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/control
    ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory
    ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/metric
    ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors
    │ ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/temperature
    │ │ ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/temperature/Nvidia_SMA_10_TEMP_0
    │ │ ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/temperature/Nvidia_SMA_20_TEMP_0
    │ │ ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/temperature/Nvidia_SMA_30_TEMP_0
    │ │ ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/temperature/Nvidia_SMA_40_TEMP_0
    │ │ ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/temperature/Nvidia_SMA_50_TEMP_0
    │ │ ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/temperature/Nvidia_SMA_60_TEMP_0
    │ │ └─ /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/temperature/Nvidia_SMA_70_TEMP_0
    │ └─ /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/voltage
    │   ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/voltage/Nvidia_SMA_10_LEAKDETECTOR_0
    │   ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/voltage/Nvidia_SMA_20_LEAKDETECTOR_0
    │   ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/voltage/Nvidia_SMA_40_LEAKDETECTOR_2
    │   ├─ /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/voltage/Nvidia_SMA_60_LEAKDETECTOR_2
    │   └─ /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/voltage/Nvidia_SMA_70_LEAKDETECTOR_2
    └─ /xyz/openbmc_project/software
```
2. Each leak detector successfully publishes the
   xyz.openbmc_project.Sensor.Value interface, exposing the voltage
   value read from the device:
```
busctl introspect xyz.openbmc_project.GpuSensor \
  /xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/voltage/Nvidia_SMA_10_LEAKDETECTOR_0 \
  xyz.openbmc_project.Sensor.Value
NAME      TYPE     SIGNATURE RESULT/VALUE                                  FLAGS
.MaxValue property d         5                                             emits-change
.MinValue property d         0                                             emits-change
.Unit     property s         "xyz.openbmc_project.Sensor.Value.Unit.Volts" emits-change
.Value    property d         1.743                                         emits-change writable
```
3. Unit tests for the NvidiaSmaLeakSensor pass.

